      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-10-17_WidnesExaminer_art0031" n="art0031">
        <head>LARGESr SALE OF ANY COUGH AND LUNG MEDFINE IN THE WORLD.</head>
        <p>LARGESr SALE OF ANY COUGH AND LUNG MEDFINE IN THE WORLD.</p>
        <p>BRONCHITIS.</p>
        <p>There are thousands of children who die annually from Bronchitis, Whooping Cough, and Croup. A 2rand discovery has beeu made for the cure of such compl4ints. namely, TUDOR WILLIAMS' BALSAM OF HONEY, which contains Welsh honey and an essence extracted from a selection of the purest and most efficacious herbs. A Swansea lady declares that this Balsam acts like magic on her children whenever they are afflcted with one of these kindred complaints.</p>
