        <head>BRITISH ARMY SPEAKS HIGHLY OF IT.</head>
        <p>THE BRITISH ARMY SPEAKS HIGHLY OF IT.</p>
        <p>During the tw ) years that our Regiment was in Pew. broke Dock I used yoar Tulor Williams' Balsam of Honey,and found that there was not another Cough and Lung Cure on the British market equal to it. Send Me on a case for my friends at ONCE.—B tnci Sergeant W. BARDS, Ist Bat. The Conn. Rangers, 4.nglesea Barracks, Portsea, Portsmouth,</p>
        <p>ACTING ARMY SCHOOLMASTER Sir.—Enclose cheque for a further supply of your Tudor 1-lisam of Honey. I have used it tit many cases of and Colds. It has never failed to effect a complr to cure.—Prof. GEO. H. ATKINSON, Aldershot.</p>
